[32m[K301[m[K[36m[K-[m[K/// \remarks The timeline is the animation channel for a single joint.
[32m[K302[m[K[36m[K-[m[K/// Timelines store the collection of keyframes for a single joint.
[32m[K303[m[K[36m[K-[m[K/// An array of timelines is stored in the TMdfAnimation object. The array
