[32m[K319[m[K[36m[K-[m[K//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
[32m[K320[m[K[36m[K-[m[K/// \brief MDF Animation Object for a single mesh
[32m[K321[m[K[36m[K-[m[K/// \author Ivgeni Segal
[32m[K322[m[K[36m[K-[m[K/// \date January 20, 2007
[32m[K323[m[K[36m[K-[m[K///
[32m[K324[m[K[36m[K-[m[K/// MDF Animation object stores an array of joint timeline channels
[32m[K325[m[K[36m[K-[m[K/// which in term contain the keyframes for each joint
