//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
/// \brief Transitional vertex format
/// \author Ivgeni Segal
/// \date January 20, 2007
///
/// transitional vertex format for use with exporters.
/// This structure is used by the mesh-building functions of the MDF 
